From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:14:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a2xx, st/mesa: gl_ClipVertex on Xenos

Xenos user clip planes (PA_CL_UCP_n) test the clip-space position, so a
GLSL vertex shader's gl_ClipVertex was ignored.

- New pipe cap clip_planes_lower_clip_vertex: the state tracker lowers
  the user clip planes to clip distances, as it does without
  clip_planes, for a vertex shader that writes gl_ClipVertex.
- fd2: a vertex shader writing clip distances turns the hardware planes
  off in PA_CL_CLIP_CNTL; fragment shader variants keyed on the plane
  mask run nir_lower_clip_fs (discard on a negative distance). The
  fragment variant is now picked before the vertex variant, which links
  to its inputs.

piglit clip-plane-transformation clipvert_pos and pos_clipvert pass.
dEQP 17063/17075, no regressions; performance unchanged.

